  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The purpose of this data set was to identify the impact of experimental warming on the chemical composition of tundra plants and lichens, as it relates to caribou and reindeer (Rangifer) forage quality. Rangifer populations have been in decline across the Arctic. The impact of warming on their forage quantity is well documented but impacts on forage quality have not been addressed. Forage quality is critical to Rangifer health and body condition."
  ],
